            "evidence_refs": [],
            "xml": "<ns0:comment xmlns:ns0=\"https://uniprot.org/uniprot\" type=\"subcellular location\">\n        <ns0:subcellularLocation>\n            <ns0:location evidence=\"2 3 5\">Plastid</ns0:location>\n            <ns0:location evidence=\"2 3 5\">Chloroplast thylakoid membrane</ns0:location>\n            <ns0:topology evidence=\"1\">Single-pass membrane protein</ns0:topology>\n        </ns0:subcellularLocation>\n        <ns0:text evidence=\"2\">Associated with both photosystems I and II.</ns0:text>\n    </ns0:comment>\n    "
          },
          {
            "type": "tissue specificity",
            "text": "Mostly expressed in cotyledons and shoot apices.",
            "evidence_refs": [],
            "xml": "<ns0:comment xmlns:ns0=\"https://uniprot.org/uniprot\" type=\"tissue specificity\">\n        <ns0:text evidence=\"3\">Mostly expressed in cotyledons and shoot apices.</ns0:text>\n    </ns0:comment>\n    "
          },
          {
            "type": "developmental stage",
            "text": "Highly expressed in seedling cotyledons and shoot apices in young and mature plants.",
            "evidence_refs": [],
            "xml": "<ns0:comment xmlns:ns0=\"https://uniprot.org/uniprot\" type=\"developmental stage\">\n        <ns0:text evidence=\"3\">Highly expressed in seedling cotyledons and shoot apices in young and mature plants.</ns0:text>\n    </ns0:comment>\n    "
          },
          {
            "type": "induction",
            "text": "Induced by exposure to high light (PubMed:10794534, PubMed:29438089, PubMed:30489183). Expression follows circadian diurnal fluctuations with highest levels before and shortly after the light phase (PubMed:10794534).",
            "evidence_refs": [],
            "xml": "<ns0:comment xmlns:ns0=\"https://uniprot.org/uniprot\" type=\"induction\">\n        <ns0:text evidence=\"2 3 6\">Induced by exposure to high light (PubMed:10794534, PubMed:29438089, PubMed:30489183). Expression follows circadian diurnal fluctuations with highest levels before and shortly after the light phase (PubMed:10794534).</ns0:text>\n    </ns0:comment>\n    "
          },
          {
            "type": "disruption phenotype",
            "text": "High light sensitivity leading to stunted growth with pale-green leaves on agar plates, but unable to grow on soil (PubMed:29438089). Impaired photosystem II (PSII) core protein function and reduced levels of photosystem I core proteins (PubMed:29438089).",
            "evidence_refs": [],
            "xml": "<ns0:comment xmlns:ns0=\"https://uniprot.org/uniprot\" type=\"disruption phenotype\">\n        <ns0:text evidence=\"3\">High light sensitivity leading to stunted growth with pale-green leaves on agar plates, but unable to grow on soil (PubMed:29438089). Impaired photosystem II (PSII) core protein function and reduced levels of photosystem I core proteins (PubMed:29438089).</ns0:text>\n    </ns0:comment>\n    "
          },
